    {
      "displayText": "這位路人！在寶可夢對戰時，\n要是能一邊攻擊一邊回復HP有多好！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳是不是有這麼想過？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 168,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90194F4D8DEF4EBAFF0157285BF653EF59225C0D62306642FF0C000A8981662F80FD4E00908A653B64CA4E00908A56DE5FA9004800506709591A597DFF0100100001BE00000A00100003110000FF01014F6059B3662F4E0D662F670990199EBC60F3904EFF1F00100002011401520000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "如果用能夠吸取HP的招式，就辦得到囉！\n每攻擊一次，就回復一次！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 280,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5982679C752880FD5920543853D600480050768462DB5F0FFF0C5C318FA65F97523056C9FF01000A6BCF653B64CA4E006B21FF0C5C3156DE5FA94E006B21FF0100100002011401520000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "自己的寶可夢的HP被吸走！\n對手的寶可夢的HP會回復！<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n想不想嚐嚐這恐怖的滋味呀？<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 356,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "81EA5DF176845BF653EF592276840048005088AB54388D70FF01000A5C0D624B76845BF653EF5922768400480050670356DE5FA9FF0100100001BE00000A60F34E0D60F35690569090196050601676846ECB54735440FF1F00100002011401520000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 49
    },
    {
      "displayText": "等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳準備好要對戰時，\n就來跟我說一聲吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
