      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 40
    },
    {
      "displayText": "呵呵呵！\n我來幫<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吸一些HP過來吧！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
