      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "大根莖是可以增加\nHP吸收量的道具喔。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n我分1個給<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
